{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50647","headline":"三桥隐居歌 · 周匡物","name":"三桥隐居歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁家作桥溪水头，茅堂四月如清秋。\n白云已过暮山紫，黄鸟不鸣春自幽。\n掀髯背向孤舟立，犹记仙源旧曾入。\n（近人翁国梁《漳州史蹟》亦引此诗「曾」作「会」。\n）雨打疎篷醉不知，桃花一夜新流急。\n（见《漳州府志》。\n末句《漳州史蹟》作「桃花一夜急新流」，误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周匡物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}